methods.docstring:
Register a handler for a specific key from JavaScript.

Usage::

    @win.on("btn_start")
    def on_start(value):
        print("started", value)

classes.docstring:
按键事件监听

用法::

    @KeyEvent.on()
    def on_key(event):
        print(event.key_code, event.action)

    @KeyEvent.on(key_code=24)  # KEYCODE_VOLUME_UP
    def on_volume_up(event):
        pass

    KeyEvent.stop()

触摸事件监听 (基于无障碍服务，监听控件交互)

用法::

    @TouchEvent.on()
    def on_touch(event):
        print(event.action, event.x, event.y)

    @TouchEvent.on(action="click")
    def on_click(event):
        print(f"clicked at {event.x}, {event.y}")

    TouchEvent.stop()

通知事件监听

用法::

    @NotificationEvent.on()
    def on_noti(event):
        print(event.package, event.title, event.text)

    @NotificationEvent.on(package="com.tencent.mm")
    def on_wechat(event):
        print(event.title, event.text)

    NotificationEvent.stop()

加速度计传感器

用法::

    @AccelerometerSensor.on()
    def on_accel(event):
        print(event.x, event.y, event.z)  # m/s²

    AccelerometerSensor.stop()

陀螺仪传感器

用法::

    @GyroscopeSensor.on()
    def on_gyro(event):
        print(event.x, event.y, event.z)  # rad/s

    GyroscopeSensor.stop()

光线传感器

用法::

    @LightSensor.on()
    def on_light(event):
        print(event.value)  # lux

    LightSensor.stop()

接近传感器

用法::

    @ProximitySensor.on()
    def on_proximity(event):
        print(event.value)  # cm, 通常 0=近 5=远

    ProximitySensor.stop()
